Issues / Assumptions:
- Missing concept: "TextMentionTermination" (a termination triggered by a special token in LLM output, e.g., "TERMINATE") is used in the source but not represented by any TerminationCondition class in the current ontology. I document this here rather than inventing a new class/property.
- Missing concept: explicit "StateGraph / SelectorGroupChat" execution semantics (dynamic selector/group-chat routing) are part of the original mapping but the ontology models only workflow steps and patterns. I map the StateGraph to an Orchestration + WorkflowPattern + ordered WorkflowSteps, but complex selector/selector-group semantics (e.g., dynamic selection logic) are not expressible with existing properties.
- Missing concept: typed program constructs (Python functions, LangGraph nodes/state) and precise runtime bindings (START/END tokens, runtime State updates) cannot be modeled directly. I model the semantic equivalents: WorkflowSteps (ordered), Tasks (with expected outputs), and a Schema for the shared state (TravelState).
- Assumption: LLMAgent runtime configuration is limited in the code to one explicit parameter we can observe (the LLM model name "gpt-4o"). I represent that as a Config tied to each agent. No other internal SDK or provider-specific parameters are recorded because they are implementation details.
- No changes were made to the ontology schema; only individuals (instances) from the existing classes/properties were created.

@prefix : <http://www.semanticweb.org/danilippmann/ontologies/2026/3/agentoscin/> .
@prefix dc: <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix xml: <http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix beam: <http://w3id.org/beam/core#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix agento: <http://www.w3id.org/agentic-ai/onto#> .
@prefix p-plan: <http://purl.org/net/p-plan#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

#################################################################
# Agentic system
#################################################################

:TravelPlanningSystem rdf:type :AgenticSystem ;
    rdfs:label "travel-planning (LangGraph / AutoGen port)" ;
    :hasSourceFramework "LangGraph StateGraph (port of AutoGen example)" ;
    :containsOrchestration :TravelOrchestration ;
    :containsAgent :PlannerAgent ,
                    :LocalAgent ,
                    :LanguageAgent ,
                    :TravelSummaryAgent ;
    :containsTeam :TravelTeam .

#################################################################
# Team and Orchestration / Workflow pattern
#################################################################

:TravelTeam rdf:type agento:Team ;
    rdfs:label "Travel Team" ;
    agento:hasAgentMember :PlannerAgent ,
                          :LocalAgent ,
                          :LanguageAgent ,
                          :TravelSummaryAgent .

:TravelOrchestration rdf:type :Orchestration ;
    rdfs:label "Travel Planning Orchestration (StateGraph mapping)" ;
    :orchestratesTeam :TravelTeam ;
    agento:hasWorkflowPattern :TravelWorkflowPattern .

:TravelWorkflowPattern rdf:type agento:WorkflowPattern ;
    rdfs:label "Travel workflow (sequential StateGraph)" ;
    agento:hasWorkflowStep :StartStep ,
                            :PlannerStep ,
                            :LocalStep ,
                            :LanguageStep ,
                            :SummaryStep ,
                            :EndStep .

#################################################################
# Workflow steps (ordered sequence)
#################################################################

:StartStep rdf:type agento:StartStep ;
    rdfs:label "START" ;
    agento:stepOrder 0 .

:PlannerStep rdf:type agento:WorkflowStep ;
    rdfs:label "planner_agent step" ;
    agento:stepOrder 1 ;
    :hasAssociatedAgent :PlannerAgent ;
    agento:hasAssociatedTask :PlannerTask ;
    agento:nextStep :LocalStep .

:LocalStep rdf:type agento:WorkflowStep ;
    rdfs:label "local_agent step" ;
    agento:stepOrder 2 ;
    :hasAssociatedAgent :LocalAgent ;
    agento:hasAssociatedTask :LocalTask ;
    agento:nextStep :LanguageStep .

:LanguageStep rdf:type agento:WorkflowStep ;
    rdfs:label "language_agent step" ;
    agento:stepOrder 3 ;
    :hasAssociatedAgent :LanguageAgent ;
    agento:hasAssociatedTask :LanguageTask ;
    agento:nextStep :SummaryStep .

:SummaryStep rdf:type agento:WorkflowStep ;
    rdfs:label "travel_summary_agent step" ;
    agento:stepOrder 4 ;
    :hasAssociatedAgent :TravelSummaryAgent ;
    agento:hasAssociatedTask :SummaryTask ;
    agento:nextStep :EndStep .

:EndStep rdf:type agento:EndStep ;
    rdfs:label "END" ;
    agento:stepOrder 5 .

#################################################################
# Agents (LLM-based agents)
#################################################################

# Planner agent: sketches initial itinerary
:PlannerAgent rdf:type agento:LLMAgent ;
    rdfs:label "planner_agent" ;
    agento:agentID "planner_agent" ;
    agento:agentRole "planner" ;
    :agentType "AssistantAgent (planner)" ;
    agento:hasAgentConfig :PlannerAgentConfig ;
    agento:useLanguageModel :GPT4oModel ;
    :agentPrompt :PlannerPrompt .

# Local agent: adds local activities
:LocalAgent rdf:type agento:LLMAgent ;
    rdfs:label "local_agent" ;
    agento:agentID "local_agent" ;
    agento:agentRole "local" ;
    :agentType "AssistantAgent (local)" ;
    agento:hasAgentConfig :LocalAgentConfig ;
    agento:useLanguageModel :GPT4oModel ;
    :agentPrompt :LocalPrompt .

# Language tips agent: adds language/communication advice
:LanguageAgent rdf:type agento:LLMAgent ;
    rdfs:label "language_agent" ;
    agento:agentID "language_agent" ;
    agento:agentRole "language" ;
    :agentType "AssistantAgent (language)" ;
    agento:hasAgentConfig :LanguageAgentConfig ;
    agento:useLanguageModel :GPT4oModel ;
    :agentPrompt :LanguagePrompt .

# Travel summary agent: compiles final plan and signals termination token
:TravelSummaryAgent rdf:type agento:LLMAgent ;
    rdfs:label "travel_summary_agent" ;
    agento:agentID "travel_summary_agent" ;
    agento:agentRole "summary" ;
    :agentType "AssistantAgent (summary/integration)" ;
    agento:hasAgentConfig :SummaryAgentConfig ;
    agento:useLanguageModel :GPT4oModel ;
    :agentPrompt :SummaryPrompt .

#################################################################
# Language model and agent configs
#################################################################

:GPT4oModel rdf:type agento:LanguageModel ;
    rdfs:label "gpt-4o" ;
    dcterms:title "gpt-4o" .

:PlannerAgentConfig rdf:type agento:Config ;
    rdfs:label "Planner agent config" ;
    agento:configKey "model" ;
    agento:configValue "gpt-4o" .

:LocalAgentConfig rdf:type agento:Config ;
    rdfs:label "Local agent config" ;
    agento:configKey "model" ;
    agento:configValue "gpt-4o" .

:LanguageAgentConfig rdf:type agento:Config ;
    rdfs:label "Language agent config" ;
    agento:configKey "model" ;
    agento:configValue "gpt-4o" .

:SummaryAgentConfig rdf:type agento:Config ;
    rdfs:label "Summary agent config" ;
    agento:configKey "model" ;
    agento:configValue "gpt-4o" .

#################################################################
# Tasks and expected outputs
#################################################################

:PlannerTask rdf:type agento:Task ;
    rdfs:label "Planner Task (sketch initial itinerary)" ;
    :hasExpectedOutput "plan" ;
    agento:hasPrompt :PlannerPrompt .

:LocalTask rdf:type agento:Task ;
    rdfs:label "Local Task (add local activities)" ;
    :hasExpectedOutput "local_notes" ;
    agento:hasPrompt :LocalPrompt .

:LanguageTask rdf:type agento:Task ;
    rdfs:label "Language Task (language & communication tips)" ;
    :hasExpectedOutput "language_notes" ;
    agento:hasPrompt :LanguagePrompt .

:SummaryTask rdf:type agento:Task ;
    rdfs:label "Summary Task (compile final plan)" ;
    :hasExpectedOutput "final_plan" ;
    agento:hasPrompt :SummaryPrompt .

#################################################################
# Prompts (preserve full instruction strings and mapping placeholders)
#################################################################

# Note: prompts contain placeholders referencing the shared TravelState.
:PlannerPrompt rdf:type agento:Prompt ;
    rdfs:label "Planner prompt" ;
    agento:promptInstruction
        """You are a helpful assistant that can suggest a travel plan for a user based on their request.

Request: {request}""" ;
    agento:promptInputData "TravelState.request -> {request}" ;
    agento:promptOutputIndicator "Expected to produce an initial itinerary fragment (field: plan)" ;
    :hasSourceFramework "original: LangGraph function planner_agent uses llm.invoke with above template" .

:LocalPrompt rdf:type agento:Prompt ;
    rdfs:label "Local prompt" ;
    agento:promptInstruction
        """You are a helpful assistant that can suggest authentic and interesting local activities or places to visit. Given the initial plan, contribute concrete local suggestions.

Plan so far:
{plan}""" ;
    agento:promptInputData "TravelState.plan -> {plan}" ;
    agento:promptOutputIndicator "Expected to produce local suggestions (field: local_notes)" ;
    :hasSourceFramework "original: LangGraph function local_agent uses llm.invoke with above template" .

:LanguagePrompt rdf:type agento:Prompt ;
    rdfs:label "Language prompt" ;
    agento:promptInstruction
        """You review travel plans and provide feedback on important tips about how best to address language or communication challenges for the destination.

Plan so far:
{plan}

Local suggestions:
{local_notes}""" ;
    agento:promptInputData "TravelState.plan, TravelState.local_notes -> {plan}, {local_notes}" ;
    agento:promptOutputIndicator "Expected to produce language/communication advice (field: language_notes)" ;
    :hasSourceFramework "original: LangGraph function language_agent uses llm.invoke with above template" .

:SummaryPrompt rdf:type agento:Prompt ;
    rdfs:label "Summary prompt" ;
    agento:promptInstruction
        """You compile all suggestions and advice from the other agents and provide a detailed final travel plan. Your final response must be the complete plan. When the plan is complete, conclude with TERMINATE.

Initial plan:
{plan}

Local notes:
{local_notes}

Language notes:
{language_notes}""" ;
    agento:promptInputData "TravelState.plan, TravelState.local_notes, TravelState.language_notes -> {plan}, {local_notes}, {language_notes}" ;
    agento:promptOutputIndicator "Final complete plan (field: final_plan). When complete, include the literal token: TERMINATE" ;
    :hasSourceFramework "original: LangGraph function travel_summary_agent uses llm.invoke and instructs model to conclude with TERMINATE" .

#################################################################
# Schema for shared state (TravelState) and output schema
#################################################################

:TravelStateSchema rdf:type :Schema ;
    rdfs:label "TravelState TypedDict schema" ;
    :hasSchemaDefinition
        """TypedDict TravelState {
  request: str
  plan: str
  local_notes: str
  language_notes: str
  final_plan: str
}""" .

# The orchestration produces a structured final plan aggregated into TravelState.final_plan.
:TravelOrchestration :hasOutputSchema :TravelStateSchema .

# Also attach an explicit output schema to the SummaryTask (structured final output)
:SummaryTask :hasOutputSchema :TravelStateSchema .

#################################################################
# Misc / provenance
#################################################################

:ExampleSource rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Source code provenance" ;
    dcterms:description
        "Mapping derived from main.py: four LLM-based agents (planner, local, language, summary) composed sequentially in a StateGraph. LLM configured with ChatOpenAI model 'gpt-4o'. Summary agent must conclude with the token 'TERMINATE' to finish the flow. Shared state is the TravelState TypedDict accumulating the plan and notes." .

#################################################################
# End of instance data
#################################################################